- Add a Tolerated Culture Slot and a Tolerated Religion Slot to the Tech or Legacy tree

Provincial Spirits

Mauretania
- The Two Shores: +30% Land Tax while Baelo and Tingi are annexed and cored
- Moorish Muster: +5% War Power for every 10 core tiles
- Maritime Renown: +1% Prestige for each core coastal tile (up to +50%)

Africa
- Littoral Tax Districts: +1% Land Tax on all tiles for each core coastal tile with at least 3 coastal edges
- Mercantile Mobilization: +10% War Power for each active trade
- Granary of the Empire: +1% Tile Output on all tiles for each core tile producing Grain (up to +50%)
